RADIUS: the DUT's OWN local RADIUS server (127.0.0.1) was used throughout, so
that no file outside the three repos had to be edited. Note for later: tb470
also runs FreeRADIUS and the IE520 is ALREADY an authorised client via an
Ansible-managed `client 10.38.0.0/16 { secret = secret }` block, with users
test_user/test_pass and user15 available -- that route needs no testbox writes
either and is the one to use if a remote server is required.
